  "label": "Hateful Meme Format",
  "description": "The format of the meme — pairing an image of an aggressive animal with hateful text — is a known trope in internet culture used to express extreme views in a seemingly 'serious' or 'authentic' way. This format relies on the audience's understanding of meme conventions and the use of visual metaphors to convey toxic messages, which is a real-world cultural phenomenon.",
